OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Ffine evening with plenty of late
OL,7,Fsunshine. Overnight will remain dry
OL,8,Fwith clear spells and light winds, but
OL,9,Ffeeling a little warmer than recent
OL,10,Fnights.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FAnother fine and dry day with
OL,13,Fplenty of sunshine. Feeling hot in the
OL,14,Fsunshine and light winds. Potential
OL,15,Ffor some patchy cloud and some showers
OL,16,Fin northern parts later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
