OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSome
OL,6,Fpatchy cloud around initially Monday,
OL,7,Fbefore the sunny weather returns,
OL,8,Fpersisting through Tuesday and
OL,9,FWednesday. Temperatures briefly dip on
OL,10,FMonday before becoming hot once again
OL,11,Fby Wednesday.
